WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:07.422
Izzie was smiling as everyone put on their aprons.

2
00:00:07.423 --> 00:00:11.312
"Something exciting happened yesterday!"

3
00:00:11.313 --> 00:00:14.655
"What?" Nina asked.

4
00:00:14.656 --> 00:00:19.497
"Mom said I was being super responsible taking care of Gurpy.

5
00:00:19.498 --> 00:00:22.327
So she let me get a hamster.

6
00:00:22.328 --> 00:00:25.070
I named her Nibbles."

7
00:00:25.071 --> 00:00:29.047
"Wow, that's cool!" Jason said.

8
00:00:29.048 --> 00:00:31.471
Chef pointed to the recipe.

9
00:00:31.472 --> 00:00:34.651
"Today we're making vegetable pancakes."

10
00:00:34.652 --> 00:00:36.602
Bobby made a face.

11
00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:40.188
"Vegetables? In pancakes?"

12
00:00:40.189 --> 00:00:43.593
"Oh, yachaejeon !" Nina said.

13
00:00:43.594 --> 00:00:46.686
"They're Korean pancakes."

14
00:00:46.687 --> 00:00:49.069
"That's right," Chef said.

15
00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.126
"Let's prep the vegetables.

16
00:00:51.127 --> 00:00:53.713
We need two and a half cups."

17
00:00:53.714 --> 00:00:58.336
"That's a lot of vegetables," Bobby said.

18
00:00:58.337 --> 00:01:02.148
"Vegetables are good for you!" Izzie said.

19
00:01:02.149 --> 00:01:06.870
"Eating healthy food is responsible."

20
00:01:06.871 --> 00:01:12.138
Nina read the ingredients. "Onion, carrot, zucchini."

21
00:01:12.139 --> 00:01:15.911
Then she paused. "Um, Chef?

22
00:01:15.912 --> 00:01:18.457
Can we use green onions?

23
00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:22.479
My aunt uses them when she makes yachaejeon

24
00:01:22.480 --> 00:01:29.171
." "Sure," Chef said. "We can use any kind of

25
00:01:29.172 --> 00:01:32.550
vegetables." The kids started cutting vegetables into

26
00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:34.569
strips. Izzie cut a

27
00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:36.798
carrot. Bobby sliced an

28
00:01:36.799 --> 00:01:39.932
onion. Jason worked on a

29
00:01:39.933 --> 00:01:42.339
zucchini. Izzie pointed to the

30
00:01:42.340 --> 00:01:47.492
recipe. "You're supposed to cut it into thin strips,

31
00:01:47.493 --> 00:01:51.775
Jason." Jason shrugged. "They all taste the

32
00:01:51.776 --> 00:01:57.176
same." "Be responsible and follow the directions," Izzie

33
00:01:57.177 --> 00:02:00.952
said. "My carrot slices look perfect."

34
00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:06.350
"Sorry!" Jason said in a teasing voice.

35
00:02:06.351 --> 00:02:09.293
"I'm not as perfect as you are."

36
00:02:09.294 --> 00:02:13.958
Bobby giggled. Izzie frowned at him.

37
00:02:13.959 --> 00:02:17.719
"You boys are immature," Izzie said.

38
00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:21.915
" Super

39
00:02:21.916 --> 00:02:25.417
immature!" Nina finished slicing green

40
00:02:25.418 --> 00:02:29.966
onions. Once all the vegetables were ready, they put them in a

41
00:02:29.967 --> 00:02:34.825
bowl. "Next we add flour, salt, and water," Jason

42
00:02:34.826 --> 00:02:41.180
said. Nina stirred the mixture until the vegetables were all coated. "It's

43
00:02:41.181 --> 00:02:48.762
ready." Chef added cooking oil to a frying

44
00:02:48.763 --> 00:02:52.987
pan. When it was hot, he added the vegetable mixture to the

45
00:02:52.988 --> 00:02:57.804
pan. "I'll make one big pancake for now. We can share

46
00:02:57.805 --> 00:03:01.920
it." "Are vegetable pancakes good?" Bobby

47
00:03:01.921 --> 00:03:06.584
asked. Nina nodded. "They're really

48
00:03:06.585 --> 00:03:09.933
yummy." Bobby grinned. "I'll try

49
00:03:09.934 --> 00:03:15.372
it. Trying new things is super responsible—like Izzie!"

50
00:03:15.373 --> 00:03:19.650
"Why don't you guys make the dipping sauce?" Chef said.

51
00:03:19.651 --> 00:03:25.345
Izzie put soy sauce, vinegar, and red pepper flakes in a bowl.

52
00:03:25.346 --> 00:03:29.072
Bobby shook in some sesame seeds.

53
00:03:29.073 --> 00:03:35.143
"Bobby!" Izzie said. "You didn't measure them carefully!"

54
00:03:35.144 --> 00:03:38.756
"It's fine," Bobby said.

55
00:03:38.757 --> 00:03:41.737
Chef slid the pancake out of the pan.

56
00:03:41.738 --> 00:03:48.376
He put it on a plate and cut it up.

57
00:03:48.377 --> 00:03:50.520
Izzie gulped.

58
00:03:50.521 --> 00:03:54.002
The pancake didn't look like the pancakes she ate at home.

59
00:03:54.003 --> 00:03:58.993
What if she didn't like it? Would her friends tease her?

60
00:03:58.994 --> 00:04:04.109
"Hmm, crunchy and delicious!" Bobby said.

61
00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:08.581
"I'm going to make these at home!" Jason said.

62
00:04:08.582 --> 00:04:10.615
Izzie was quiet.

63
00:04:10.616 --> 00:04:13.539
"Try it," Nina whispered.

64
00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:16.813
"It's okay if you don't like it."

65
00:04:16.814 --> 00:04:21.885
Izzie took a small bite. Then a bigger one.

66
00:04:21.886 --> 00:04:26.088
"I love yachaejeon !" She smiled.

67
00:04:26.089 --> 00:04:31.203
"Almost as much as I love my pets!"

68
00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:35.469
Later Chef gave Izzie some chopped zucchini.

69
00:04:35.470 --> 00:04:38.038
"It's a good snack for your hamster."

70
00:04:38.039 --> 00:04:42.108
"Thanks!" Izzie said.

71
00:04:42.109 --> 00:04:47.208
As she walked outside with her friends, she cleared her throat.

72
00:04:47.209 --> 00:04:51.565
"I'm sorry if I was bossy today."

73
00:04:51.566 --> 00:04:55.375
"You were bossy!" Bobby said.

74
00:04:55.376 --> 00:04:58.369
"But it's okay," Nina said.

75
00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:07.156
Jason nodded. "And saying sorry is super responsible!"

